# Copy to .env.local for local development against a real backend.
# Leave VITE_API_URL empty to run the built-in demo (sample data, simulated PayPal + push).
# With it set, the app talks to Apps Script; add ?demo to the address (or use
# "See a demo with sample data" on the sign-in screen) to try the demo instead.

# Apps Script web app URL (Deploy > Manage deployments > Web app URL, ends in /exec)
VITE_API_URL=

# Push notifications need no setting here: the app gets the push Worker's
# public key from Apps Script (see workers/push/README.md).
